      `the day on which the person complied` IS A MAYBE DATE
      `the day on which the question is asked` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790HA(3) the person has complied with the duty in subsection (2) in time` MEANS
    `s 790D(4)(b) the act was done by the last day of the period` (`s 790HA(3) the last day for the person to comply with the duty in subsection (2)` `the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met`) `the day on which the person complied` `the day on which the question is asked` -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must comply with the duty in subsection (2) before the end of the period of one month beginning with the day on which the conditions in subsection (1) are met"

§§ `Enforcement of disclosure requirements (s 790I)`

-- src:10383 | Schedule 1B contains provisions for when a person (whether an individual or a legal entity) fails to comply with—
-- src:10384 | (a) a notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA, or
-- src:10385 | (b) a duty under section 790G, 790H or 790HA.
@ref s 790I Schedule 1B contains provisions for when a person fails to comply (src:10383-10385)
GIVEN `the person fails to comply with a notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person fails to comply with a duty under section 790G, 790H or 790HA` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790I Schedule 1B contains provisions for the person's failure` MEANS
    IF `the person fails to comply with a notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA` OR `the person fails to comply with a duty under section 790G, 790H or 790HA`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "provisions for when a person (whether an individual or a legal entity) fails to comply with— (a) a notice under section 790D, 790DA, 790E or 790EA, or (b) a duty under section 790G, 790H or 790HA"

§§ `Power to make exemptions (s 790J)`

-- src:10404 | (1) The Secretary of State may exempt a person (whether an individual or a legal entity) under this section.
@ref s 790J(1) The Secretary of State may exempt a person (whether an individual or a legal entity) (src:10404)
GIVEN `the person is an individual or a legal entity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(1) the Secretary of State may exempt the person under this section` MEANS
    IF `the person is an individual or a legal entity`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a person (whether an individual or a legal entity)"

-- src:10405 | (2) The effect of an exemption is—
-- src:10406 | (a) the person is not required to comply with any notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA (but if a notice is received, the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent it),
@ref s 790J(2)(a) The person is not required to comply with any notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA (src:10405-10406)
GIVEN `the person has been exempted under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(2)(a) the person is not required to comply with a notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The effect of an exemption is"

@ref s 790J(2)(a) if a notice is received, the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company (src:10406)
GIVEN `the person has been exempted under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person has received a notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(2)(a) the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent the notice` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section` AND `the person has received a notice under section 790D, 790E or 790EA`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(but if a notice is received, the person must bring the existence of the exemption to the attention of the company that sent it)"

-- src:10407 | (b) companies are not obliged to take steps or give notice under those sections to or with respect to that person,
@ref s 790J(2)(b) companies are not obliged to take steps or give notice under those sections to or with respect to that person (src:10407)
GIVEN `the person has been exempted under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(2)(b) companies are not obliged to take steps or give notice under sections 790D, 790E and 790EA to or with respect to the person` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The effect of an exemption is"

-- src:10408 | (c) notices under section 790DA do not require anyone else to give any information about that person,
@ref s 790J(2)(c) notices under section 790DA do not require anyone else to give any information about that person (src:10408)
GIVEN `the person has been exempted under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(2)(c) notices under section 790DA do not require anyone else to give any information about the person` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The effect of an exemption is"

-- src:10409 | (d) the duties imposed by sections 790G 790H and 790HA do not apply to that person, and
@ref s 790J(2)(d) the duties imposed by sections 790G 790H and 790HA do not apply to that person (src:10409)
GIVEN `the person has been exempted under this section` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 790J(2)(d) the duties imposed by sections 790G, 790H and 790HA do not apply to the person` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The effect of an exemption is"

-- src:10410 | (e) the person does not count for the purposes of any of sections 12A, 790LA, 790LC, 790LD, 790LE, 790LF, 790LG, 790LH and 790LM to 790LS as a registrable person or, as the case may be, a registrable relevant legal entity in relation to any company.
