`s 790J(2)(e) the person does not count as a registrable person or registrable relevant legal entity for the purposes of sections 12A, 790LA, 790LC, 790LD, 790LE, 790LF, 790LG, 790LH and 790LM to 790LS` MEANS
    IF `the person has been exempted under this section`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The effect of an exemption is"

